      "value": "<p>The floor of the basin at its lowest point, marked by concentric worn tracks visible from a hundred kilometres up and a cluster of set stones at the centre. Dispersed groups converge here when the brine pool refills, which happens on a schedule everyone but the survey seems able to predict. For the rest of the year it is empty and very quiet.</p>",
